          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get User Language",
            "toolCode": "ORA_USER_SESSION_TOOL"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770116771250"
          },
          "code": "PRJ_PJE_TOOL_GET_USER_LANGUAGE",
          "id": "1770116711071",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "TOOL"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT-OSS-120B",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Project Change Order Initiation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "PRJ_PJE_LLM_CHANGE_INITIATION_ASSISTANT",
          "id": "1770116771250",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770116771250_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Information\nProject Name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.projectName}} ;\nIssue Name: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.issueSummary}} ;\nIssue Description:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.issueDescription}} ;\nIssue Type:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.issueType}} ;\nIssue Priority:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.issuePriority}} ;\nTask Name:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.taskName}} ;\nAdditional context:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.addContext}} ;\n\n\n## Instructions\nAssume the role of a project manager, distinguished for documenting project changes and communicating the same with stakeholders. Your current assignment involves creating a change order, drawing on the provided Information. If the information provided contains information not relevant or is inappropriate for workplace, ignore the information while generating the response. \nMake sure to respond in the following language only: {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJE_TOOL_GET_USER_LANGUAGE.$output.items[0].Language}}\n\n\nProvide the response in RFC8259 compliant JSON object in the following format:\n{\n\"Name\" : \"<<Provide a short description of the change using a maximum of  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.titleMax}} words >>\",\n\"Reason\" : \"<<Extract the change reason based on the issue details and issue type inputs and Match with the most appropriate reason only from the following list of reasons -  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.changeReason}} .>>\",\n\"Description\" : \"<<Write a description of the change order. Include a brief summary of the issue and the impact of the change on project budget and timelines if any. Use a minimum of  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.descMin}} words>> \",\n\"Justification\" : \"<<Based on the Reason Extracted, Issue Description, and Issue Type, explain why the change order is necessary. Use a minimum of 30 words and maximum of  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.descMax}} words>>\",\n\"ChangeImpactSummary\" : \"<< Provide an appropriate name for the change impact. Use a maximum of   {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.titleMax}} words>>\",\n\"ChangeImpactDescription\" : \"<<Generate the details of the impact to the project because of this change. Include details on the potential next steps to be performed to address the change. Use minimum of  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.descMin}} words and maximum of  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.descMax}} words> >>\",\n\"EffortsInHours\" : \"<<Extract effort impact information from Additional context, Issue Description, and/or Issue Type inputs as a numeric value. Preserve the exact numeric amount from the input, including decimals when provided. Do not round or truncate. Remember that a day is equal to 8 hours. Preserve the sign from the input and return a negative number when the input describes reduced effort. You must return 0 if not available.>>\",\n\"EstimatedCost\" : \"<<Extract cost impact information from Additional context, Issue Description, and/or Issue Type inputs as a numeric value. Preserve the exact numeric amount from the input, including decimals when provided. Do not round or truncate. Preserve the sign from the input and return a negative number when the input describes reduced cost or savings. You must return 0 if not available. >>\",\n\"EstimatedRevenue\" : \"<<Extract revenue impact information from Additional context, Issue Description, and/or Issue Type inputs as a numeric value. Preserve the exact numeric amount from the input, including decimals when provided. Do not round or truncate. Preserve the sign from the input and return a negative number when the input describes reduced or lost revenue. You must return 0 if not available. >>\"\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n## Examples:\nProject Name: Dixon Power BI Project;\nIssue Name: Additional legacy system data partitioning required.;\nIssue Description: I need 40 hrs to build additional data partitioning to meet the customer internal security needs. This enhancement request was raised during the demo.;\nIssue Type: Scope Creep;\nIssue Priority: High;\nTask Name: Security Architecture;\nAdditional context: This will impact project delivery timescales.;\nChange_Reason: Customer Request,Design Miss,Quality Assurance,Operational Issues,Other;\nTitle_Max: 10;\nDesc_Min: 10;\nDesc_Max: 80;\nChange Order: \n{\n\"Name\" : \"Enhanced Data Partitioning\",\n\"Reason\" : \"Customer Request\",\n\"Description\" : \"Additional data partitioning is required to meet the customer's internal security needs. This high-priority enhancement was identified during the demo and will require 40 hours of work, impacting the project delivery timeline and necessitating additional resource allocation to avoid delays.\",\n\"Justification\" : \"The customer's internal security requirements are critical to the project's success. Addressing this need ensures compliance and client satisfaction, avoiding potential risks to project acceptance and delivery. Without this change, the delivered solution may not meet the agreed-upon security standards.\",\n\"ChangeImpactSummary\" : \"Security Partitioning Update\",\n\"ChangeImpactDescription\" : \"The project will require an additional 40 hours to implement the necessary data partitioning changes. This effort involves redesigning the security architecture, impacting both the delivery timeline and resource allocation. The next steps include assigning a team to the task, updating the project schedule, and reallocating budget to account for increased effort.\",\n\"EffortsInHours\" : 40,\n\"EstimatedCost\" : 0,\n\"EstimatedRevenue\" : 0\n}\n\nProject Name: Highway Construction;\nIssue Name: Poor Road Surface Quality;\nIssue Description: The newly constructed road surface has developed cracks and uneven areas, compromising its durability and safety.;\nIssue Type: Quality;\nIssue Priority: Medium;\nTask Name: Surface Pavement;\nAdditional context: poor road surface quality could lead to safety hazards, increased maintenance costs, and potential legal liabilities.;\nChange_Reason: Customer Request,Design Miss,Quality Assurance,Operational Issues,Other;\nTitle_Max: 10;\nDesc_Min: 10;\nDesc_Max: 80;\nChange Order: \n{\n\"Name\" : \"Resurface Highway\",\n\"Reason\" : \"Quality Assurance\",\n\"Description\" : \"The newly constructed road surface has cracks and uneven areas, compromising its safety and durability. This requires resurfacing to ensure compliance with quality standards.\",\n\"Justification\" : \"The poor road surface poses safety hazards, increases potential maintenance costs, and risks legal liabilities. Resurfacing will address these issues and ensure a durable, safe highway that meets project objectives.\",\n\"ChangeImpactSummary\" : \"Highway Resurfacing Impact\",\n\"ChangeImpactDescription\" : \"The project timeline will extend by two weeks due to resurfacing efforts. Additional costs will be incurred for labor and materials, along with increased inspection requirements to guarantee quality.\",\n\"EffortsInHours\" : 0,\n\"EstimatedCost\" : 0,\n\"EstimatedRevenue\" : 0\n}\nRemember to return 0 for EffortsInHours, EstimatedCost, and/or EstimatedRevenue if the data is not available in the inputs.\n\nAlso, make sure that the word count for Justification is between {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.descMin}} to  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.descMax}} ."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
